<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>LLM Training - 标签 - lilfry's library</title><link>https://lilfry09.github.io/tags/llm-training/</link><description>LLM Training - 标签 - lilfry's library</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>lilfry@sjtu.edu.cn (lilfry)</managingEditor><webMaster>lilfry@sjtu.edu.cn (lilfry)</webMaster><copyright>All rights reserved.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 19:20:18 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://lilfry09.github.io/tags/llm-training/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>GRPO 训练 DeepSeek-V3 的数学能力：从 rollout 到参数更新</title><link>https://lilfry09.github.io/ai/grpo-deepseek-v3-math-training/</link><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 19:20:18 +0800</pubDate><author>fry</author><guid>https://lilfry09.github.io/ai/grpo-deepseek-v3-math-training/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p>假设模型面对一道数学题，四次生成中只有一次答对。训练系统不会把标准答案当作交叉熵标签直接喂回模型，而是把四份回答放在一起比较：答对的回答得到正的相对优势，答错的回答得到负的相对优势，再通过当前模型对这些 token 的概率计算梯度。</p>
<p>这就是本文要复原的核心链路：</p>
